# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# YOYOPDF .gitignore
#
# This is a vanilla HTML/CSS/JS project - most libraries are loaded from a
# CDN and the static tool pages are generated by build/generate-landing.js.
# Phase 3 added an optional Vite/Vitest verification layer (package.json,
# vite.config.js, tests/) on top of that unchanged architecture; its only
# generated output is dist/, ignored below alongside the usual Node noise.
#
# Note: .claude/launch.json IS intentionally tracked (it defines the dev
# server used by the preview tooling) - see the explicit un-ignore at the
# bottom, which keeps it committed even if .claude/ is ever ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----- OS / filesystem noise -----
# desktop.ini and Thumbs.db matter here specifically because this project
# lives on a synced Google Drive folder on Windows, which creates both.
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Google Drive / Dropbox sync conflict duplicates
*conflicted copy*
*Conflict*
*(1).html
*(2).html

# ----- Editors / IDEs -----
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project

# ----- Node (Phase 3: Vite/Vitest tooling) -----
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/
.pnpm-store/
dist/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# ----- Python (dev-server.py) -----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ----- Logs / temp / scratch -----
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
.cache/
tmp/
temp/

# ----- Local env / secrets -----
# No secrets exist in this project today (everything runs client-side and
# there is no backend), but this keeps it that way by default.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ----- Local build/deploy scratch -----
# Deployment zips produced for hand-uploading to Netlify, etc.
yoyopdf-deploy*.zip
*.rar

# ----- Explicitly KEEP (already tracked) -----
!.claude/
!.claude/launch.json
